sequenceDiagram
    title COMP-UC08 选择并预订一日游或周边游产品——组件级顺序图
    actor User as 用户
    participant Page as AttractionList.vue / MyOrders.vue
    participant Controller as TourProductController
    participant Service as TourProductServiceImpl
    participant Product as Product/Step Mapper
    participant Booking as Schedule/Order Mapper
    User->>Page: 浏览产品并选择班期、人数与联系人
    Page->>Controller: GET /list；POST /orders + Idempotency-Key
    Controller->>Service: listByType()/createBooking(userId,dto)
    Service->>Product: 查询产品与行程步骤
    Service->>Booking: 查询班期并条件扣减 available_stock
    alt 扣减成功
        Service->>Booking: INSERT tm_tour_order
        Booking-->>Service: 返回订单
        Service-->>Controller: 订单号、日期、人数、单价与总额
        Controller-->>Page: 展示订单并进入本地游订单页签
    else 参数、价格、班期或库存校验失败
        Service-->>Controller: 事务回滚并返回业务错误
        Controller-->>Page: 展示错误，不伪造成功订单
    else 相同幂等键重试
        Service-->>Controller: 返回已存在订单，不重复扣库存
    end
    Note over User,Booking: GET /orders 与 /orders/{orderNo} 均按当前用户隔离
